  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7e1f790693c494d449c01897a975fc1a, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The salon on Rustaveli. Two perms, a colour, and my own jaw.
    midDaysAnswer: The river market. I traded a haircut for filler. Tell no one.
    finalDaysAnswer: The salon. I was working on myself. I lost track of hours.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: My salon on Plekhanov Avenue. The light is good for colour.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The barracks. I cut soldiers' hair now. The salon closed weeks ago.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Home. I shut the salon last month. No one left worth cutting.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: The supply depot. Do not ask what I bought.
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: From the mirror. I have been working on myself. Non-stop.
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: I do not remember leaving. I was in the mirror a long time.
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Jaw bruising. Self-administered filler. It settles by Sunday.
    midDaysAnswer: Some swelling, numb cheeks. My pain threshold is up. A good sign.
    finalDaysAnswer: I cannot feel my cheekbones. Irrelevant. The proportions are finally correct.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Nothing. I have never had a procedure. All natural.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: No swelling. A polyclinic surgeon did my last injection.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: I feel wonderful. I stopped all procedures a month ago.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: No symptoms. These are improvements. There is a difference.
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: They are not symptoms. They are upgrades.
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: My body is cooperating fully with the vision.
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - Your skin is dehydrated, officer. Drink water. Use SPF. I beg you.
    - I opened the salon at six. I will close it when the city does.
    midDays:
    - The good products are gone. I improvise. Results are mostly fine.
    - People say I look different. I look optimised.
    finalDays:
    - My salon mirror cracked this morning. I took it as a challenge.
    - I am not finished. This is a work in progress.
    uncannyEarlyDays:
    - Stop looking at my face. I can see you looking.
    uncannyMidDays:
    - You have an opinion about my face. Keep it.
    uncannyFinalDays:
    - I am the last beautiful thing in this district.
  IDNumber: 4819263
